      en: ["The monumental statue was positioned here in the mid-19th century as a key focal point.", "The garden is located in close proximity to the reproduction of the Lourdes Grotto.", "The keys held by the statue represent the spiritual and temporal authority of the papacy.", "The avenue of cypresses behind the statue is a traditional symbol of eternal life.", "Extensive beautification of the site took place during the reign of Pope Gregory XVI.", "The garden hosts small religious ceremonies annually on the Feast of Saints Peter and Paul."],
